      "message": "Sources in the vendor/ directory are not maintained directly, \u0027go mod edit\u0027 auto-added the license file (commit msg edit pending).\n\nvoltha-protos - these edits are a release cleanup patch, structures in the repo were updated a while back but not all of the consuming repositories were updated.\n\nThese problems tend to surface and are fixed late during release builds, an agenda item was added in the TST meeting two weeks ago to remind about updating dependencies.\n\nVERSION file update -- explicitly/requiring comments for this file will be overkill imho.  A VERSION file increment is required by most VOLTHA repos before a patch will be accepted.  That implies devs need to comment on something required\n\nAlso the version file is documented on on the website:\n  o https://docs.voltha.org/master/overview/contributing.html?highlight\u003dversion%20file#versioning\n  o Should consolidate this, SemVersion and edits are mentioned in a few places.",
